{"4141900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Corrupted", "steam_appid": 4141900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Official Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss gameplay, share experiences &amp; get latest game news and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Newcomer Rewards</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/195c0db80a916e73a2c4cf12ea785a75.avif?t=1787546710\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras_big/195c0db80a916e73a2c4cf12ea785a75.avif?t=1787546710 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Corrupted is a high-octane sci-fi PVE shooter centered on satisfying progression and intense boss encounters. Plunge into Battlefields consumed by the Anomaly and push through relentless swarms, elite hunters, and colossal bosses. By mastering Core Skills, Memory Samples, and tactical precision, you will transform every run into a more aggressive, stable, and rhythmic performance of pure firepower. As you delve into higher difficulties, experience the ultimate power fantasy of a perfected build while uncovering the dark truths hidden at the heart of the corruption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE SWARM. OWN THE RHYTHM.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy isn't just an obstacle—they are the fuel for your momentum. In The Corrupted, combat is a high-speed loop of destruction. Use explosives, tactical dashes, and sustained suppressive fire to turn a desperate defense into an unstoppable advance. Every kill pushes the tempo; every encounter sharpens your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVE WITH EVERY ENCOUNTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end, but a catalyst for growth. Scavenge materials and rare components to upgrade your gear. Install Memory Samples to refine your stats and enhance your Cores to unlock devastating abilities. With every successful extraction, you return to the fray stronger, tougher, and ready for higher-intensity threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT COLOSSAL ANOMALIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Size matters, but strategy wins. The massive bosses of the exclusion zone are more than just bullet sponges—they are complex tactical puzzles. Watch for frenzy phases, dodge crushing blows, and exploit exposed weak points. Topple these giants before they flatten the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAVE YOUR OWN COMBAT STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power in The Corrupted goes beyond the trigger. Your Core System allows you to integrate shields, blink teleports, and elemental crowd control (Frost, Shock, Fire) directly into your combat flow. You aren’t just changing weapons; you are re-engineering the way you dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/d9a1461ddebc8e92190929e2c3792a93.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/d9a1461ddebc8e92190929e2c3792a93.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/d9a1461ddebc8e92190929e2c3792a93.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE CORE OF THE CORRUPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shattered cityscapes to abandoned high-tech labs, the world is a decaying warzone. As you push deeper into the anomaly, collect narrative fragments to piece together the truth behind the outbreak. The deeper you go, the more the world pushes back—and the closer you get to the heart of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/4009f7b5377d9eb0a750564c5e22577a.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/4009f7b5377d9eb0a750564c5e22577a.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/4009f7b5377d9eb0a750564c5e22577a.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GREATER RISKS, GREATER REWARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your mechanics and perfect your build to take on the highest difficulty tiers. Greater pressure yields higher-quality rewards. Each descent into the corrupted zone is a calculated gamble where skill and preparation determine the payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/20dfc5b6f634bc68f41d90bff6ad252b.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/20dfc5b6f634bc68f41d90bff6ad252b.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/20dfc5b6f634bc68f41d90bff6ad252b.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Corrupted is a high-octane sci-fi PVE shooter centered on satisfying progression and intense boss encounters. Plunge into Battlefields consumed by the Anomaly and push through relentless swarms, elite hunters, and colossal bosses. By mastering Core Skills, Memory Samples, and tactical precision, you will transform every run into a more aggressive, stable, and rhythmic performance of pure firepower. As you delve into higher difficulties, experience the ultimate power fantasy of a perfected build while uncovering the dark truths hidden at the heart of the corruption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE SWARM. OWN THE RHYTHM.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy isn't just an obstacle—they are the fuel for your momentum. In The Corrupted, combat is a high-speed loop of destruction. Use explosives, tactical dashes, and sustained suppressive fire to turn a desperate defense into an unstoppable advance. Every kill pushes the tempo; every encounter sharpens your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/71b3758fa363253cd915a8c3eec75a30.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVE WITH EVERY ENCOUNTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end, but a catalyst for growth. Scavenge materials and rare components to upgrade your gear. Install Memory Samples to refine your stats and enhance your Cores to unlock devastating abilities. With every successful extraction, you return to the fray stronger, tougher, and ready for higher-intensity threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/18070bd7569d3127535d0b2a55dc6da0.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT COLOSSAL ANOMALIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Size matters, but strategy wins. The massive bosses of the exclusion zone are more than just bullet sponges—they are complex tactical puzzles. Watch for frenzy phases, dodge crushing blows, and exploit exposed weak points. Topple these giants before they flatten the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.webm?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/be6b345c725974a6f723d033420b3230.mp4?t=1787546710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAVE YOUR OWN COMBAT STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power in The Corrupted goes beyond the trigger. Your Core System allows you to integrate shields, blink teleports, and elemental crowd control (Frost, Shock, Fire) directly into your combat flow. You aren’t just changing weapons; you are re-engineering the way you dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141900/extras/d9a1461ddebc8e92190929e2c3792a93.poster.avif?t=1787546710\" wid